WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.239
To summarize the numbers: on CIFAR-10,

00:00:03.319 --> 00:00:11.014
DAB achieves a best-in-class OOD AUROC of 0.986
against SVHN and 0.922 against CIFAR-100,

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:15.469
and a misclassification calibration AUROC of 0.930.

00:00:15.549 --> 00:00:17.041
At ImageNet scale,

00:00:17.121 --> 00:00:24.466
DAB built on a fine-tuned ResNet-50 beats a
five-model ensemble on misclassification,

00:00:24.546 --> 00:00:31.105
0.868 versus 0.861, and on out-of-distribution
detection against ImageNet-O,

00:00:31.185 --> 00:00:36.957
0.743 versus 0.642, all while using far fewer
trainable parameters,

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:42.810
roughly thirty-six million versus one hundred and
eighteen million.
